{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detachment Crew is a sci-fi dungeon crawling game where you control a party of handcrafted characters, trying to restore a recently disabled mining facility.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/CrewLoopDiff.gif?t=1745332856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully select your crew, as every character has unique skills for combat and for deeper exploration of the industrial hellscape surrounding the mining tower. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/foodt.png?t=1745332856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather enough food to feed your crew every day. Some of the crew members can be very picky eaters, so be careful.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/extras/ENVIROt.png?t=1745332856\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore various biomes, from lush forests and wild mountains to deep mines of the Concern Operation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647070?t=1745332856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3647070?t=1745332856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/540bd5abe2223011d9f1fc7bff0037025bf7bd80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745332856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3647070/540bd5abe2223011d9f1fc7bff0037025bf7bd80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745332856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id"